Z||000000||JetroGT||02-02-2001||08:04 PM||||I was driving to the eye doctors for my one week follow up for my Lasik surgury. Getting there was not the problem. Not one block away from leaving the eye doctors my auto tranny goes out on me. I'm not too upset about it. The thing lasted for 138000 miles! I had it towed to the dealer that basically came off like they didn't want to look at my 87 GT. I got there around 5:20pm. The service was good. I droped it off and one of the service advisors even gave me a ride back to my apartment! So all in all I was judging the dealer on just one persons attitude. If the tranny is really bad I'll just have them put in a re-man tranny. ||||reg||11
